🧮 Important Formulas

Solid| Volume| Surface Area
Cube| a³| TSA = 6a²
Cuboid| l × b × h| TSA = 2(lb + bh + lh)
Cylinder| πr²h| CSA = 2πrh
Cone| ⅓πr²h| CSA = πrl
Sphere| ⁴⁄₃πr³| 4πr²
Hemisphere| ⅔πr³| TSA = 3πr²
